note The refactor's proof: every CLI and GUI scenario with CODEMAP_BASE_BIN and with this build, and with CODEMAP_PARITY_REV the repo itself at that revision, its real map included, as a second fixture. Differences are kept on disk for a diff tool, both sides under the scratch directory parity/, and printed on failure. CODEMAP_PARITY_ONLY=<substring> plays only the scenarios whose name has it. Run it with CODEMAP_BASE_BIN=<old codemap> [CODEMAP_PARITY_REV=<rev>] cargo test --release --test parity -- --ignored.

