note The PATH every child process gets: jj and git and no language server. On Unix a directory of links to the two, since git's own directory can hold a server (/usr/bin/clangd on macOS); on Windows their directories, since a link to git.exe does not run there. The links live in one scratch directory shared by every test in the process, so a failed symlink is ignored: a test running beside this one may have made it. Indexing is then tree-sitter's and deterministic, while diff and repin still reach jj and git.

