note Runs the window with CODEMAP_SCRIPT and reads stderr as it arrives, so a scenario's hook can edit files on disk at a line the script marks; that is how live reload is pinned: the reload scenario edits a source file at rect edit-source and a note through the CLI at rect edit-map. {shots} in a script stands for the directory the screenshots go to.

