file tests/common/mod.rs
symbol fixture
lines 0 15
hash c86c91537f25a3a7
note A fresh copy of the fixture at a fixed place per scenario, so two builds played in turn see the same absolute paths (the status bar prints the map's path, and the screenshots compare it). The scratch directory lies under the system temp directory, outside any repository so a fixture finds no VCS of its own, and under the process id so concurrent runs do not share it. The map is built through the CLI, the way an agent builds one.
